WEBVTT

00:00.800 --> 00:03.600
Your search data is trying to tell you something.

00:04.550 --> 00:05.400
Meet Blink.

00:06.100 --> 00:09.650
He sees it all. Clicks, impressions, position.

00:10.250 --> 00:11.400
So just ask him.

00:12.500 --> 00:15.400
He answers from your own numbers, right on your phone.

00:16.500 --> 00:19.050
More than one site? Switch or compare.

00:20.500 --> 00:22.700
Need to share it? He writes the report.

00:24.200 --> 00:25.750
And he keeps watch.

00:26.700 --> 00:28.500
Search Console, with Blink.

00:29.200 --> 00:31.100
Try it free on the App Store.
